@startuml cart-write

title Cart - 新增 / 更新 / 刪除流程

actor User
participant "API\n(Endpoint)" as API
participant "Handler\n(Use Case)" as Handler
participant "Redis\n(ICacher)" as Redis
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Add Item ==

User -> API : POST /cart/items\n{ skuId, quantity }
API -> Handler : AddCartItemCommand(userId, skuId, quantity)
Handler -> Handler : Validate (quantity > 0)

Handler -> DB : GetByUserIdAsync(userId)

alt Cart not found
  Handler -> DB : AddAsync(Cart.Create(userId))
  Handler -> Handler : cart.AddItem(skuId, quantity)
else Cart exists
  Handler -> Handler : cart.AddItem(skuId, quantity)\n(同 SKU → 數量累加)
  Handler -> DB : Update(cart)
end

Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
Handler -> Redis : RemoveAsync(cart:{userId})
Handler --> API : NoContent
API --> User : 204

== Update Item Quantity ==

User -> API : PUT /cart/items/{skuId}\n{ quantity }
API -> Handler : UpdateCartItemQuantityCommand(userId, skuId, quantity)
Handler -> Handler : Validate (quantity > 0)
Handler -> DB : GetByUserIdAsync(userId)
DB --> Handler : Cart
Handler -> Handler : cart.UpdateQuantity(skuId, quantity)
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
Handler -> Redis : RemoveAsync(cart:{userId})
Handler --> API : NoContent
API --> User : 204

== Remove Item ==

User -> API : DELETE /cart/items/{skuId}
API -> Handler : RemoveCartItemCommand(userId, skuId)
Handler -> DB : GetByUserIdAsync(userId)
DB --> Handler : Cart
Handler -> Handler : cart.RemoveItem(skuId)
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
Handler -> Redis : RemoveAsync(cart:{userId})
Handler --> API : NoContent
API --> User : 204

== Clear Cart ==

User -> API : DELETE /cart
API -> Handler : ClearCartCommand(userId)
Handler -> DB : GetByUserIdAsync(userId)
DB --> Handler : Cart
Handler -> Handler : cart.Clear()
Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
Handler -> Redis : RemoveAsync(cart:{userId})
Handler --> API : NoContent
API --> User : 204

note over DB, Redis
  下訂單後購物車清空（由 CreateOrderHandler 呼叫）：
  cart.Clear() → SaveChanges → RemoveAsync(cart:{userId})
end note

@enduml
